{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53209","headline":"诗偈 三十四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雾重日难出，云厚月朦胧。\n有心求觅佛，昼夜用心功。\n见梦言将实，闻真耳却聋。\n羣贼当路坐，道理若爲通。\n见性若玲珑，多求说处通。\n取他凡圣语，到头浑是空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}